  "goodToKnow": "Der Erfinder (die Erfinderin) is an inventor. German Erfinder include Gutenberg (printing press), Carl Benz (the automobile), Rudolf Diesel, Konrad Zuse (an early computer), and Melitta Bentz, who invented the coffee filter in 1908. Erfinden means to invent and also to make up: eine Geschichte erfinden. Das ist nicht im Sinne des Erfinders means that's not how it was intended. Die Erfindung is the invention."
